  "observations": [
    "Hosted dotnet-build and dotnet-test aggregate files exhausted the existing 300000 ms required-file deadline.",
    "A hosted CLI assertion observed exit 2 instead of 1; the captured failure did not include CLI output, so that status alone does not establish its cause.",
    "Native library fixtures explicitly selected timeoutMs 120000; the corresponding CLI/MCP validation calls previously used the engine default 30000."
  ],
  "changes": [
    "Redistribute original build callbacks into bounded files and update installed-harness copying and required identities.",
    "Use the supported 120000 ms validation allowance for native build/test/format/generated/method CLI and trusted MCP calls. Parent CLI/MCP response ceilings are 150000 ms; surface callback ceilings and required-file deadlines are 300000 ms."
  ],
